      "content": "but that's just a way to delay the inevitable. if you look at it logically, the \"weight\" of those moments is just temporary noise. if a zero plus a zero is still zero, then why does the math matter? if there's no objective meaning, then ending it isn't even \"wrong,\" it's just a neutral move. it's actually the most logical way to stop the noise.",
